.TH "VSL" "7" "" ""
.SH NAME
VSL \- Vinyl Cache Shared Memory Logging
.\" Copyright (c) 2011-2021 Varnish Software AS
.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
.\" See LICENSE file for full text of license
.
.SH OVERVIEW
.sp
This document describes the format and content of all the Vinyl Cache shared memory
logging tags. These tags are used by the vinyllog(1), vinyltop(1), etc.
logging tools supplied with Vinyl Cache.
.SS VSL tags
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B BackendClose \- Backend connection closed
Logged when a backend connection is closed.
.sp
The format is:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
%d %s %s [ %s ]
|  |  |    |
|  |  |    +\- Optional reason, see SessClose for explanation
|  |  +\-\-\-\-\-\- \(dqclose\(dq or \(dqrecycle\(dq
|  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Backend display name
+\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Connection file descriptor
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.TP
.B BackendOpen \- Backend connection opened
Logged when a new backend connection is opened.
.sp
The format is:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
%d %s %s %s %s %s %s [ %f %ld ]
|  |  |  |  |  |  |    |  |
|  |  |  |  |  |  |    |  +\-\-\- Connection reuses
|  |  |  |  |  |  |    +\-\-\-\-\-\- Connection age
|  |  |  |  |  |  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- \(dqconnect\(dq or \(dqreuse\(dq
|  |  |  |  |  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Local port
|  |  |  |  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Local address
|  |  |  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Remote port
|  |  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Remote address
|  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Backend display name
+\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Connection file descriptor
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.TP
.B Backend_health \- Backend health check
The result of a backend health probe.
.sp
The format is:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
%s %s %s %s %u %u %u %f %f %s
|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |
|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  +\- Probe HTTP response / error information
|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  +\-\-\-\- Average response time
|  |  |  |  |  |  |  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Response time
|  |  |  |  |  |  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Probe window size
|  |  |  |  |  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Probe threshold level
|  |  |  |  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Number of good probes in window
|  |  |  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Probe window bits
|  |  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- \(dqhealthy\(dq or \(dqsick\(dq
|  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- \(dqBack\(dq, \(dqStill\(dq or \(dqWent\(dq
+\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Backend name
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Probe window bits are:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
\(aq\-\(aq: Could not connect
\(aq4\(aq: Good IPv4
\(aq6\(aq: Good IPv6
\(aqU\(aq: Good UNIX
\(aqx\(aq: Error Xmit
\(aqX\(aq: Good Xmit
\(aqr\(aq: Error Recv
\(aqR\(aq: Good Recv
\(aqH\(aq: Happy
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
When the backend is just created, the window bits for health check
slots that haven\(aqt run yet appear as \(aq\-\(aq like failures to connect.
.TP
.B Begin \- Marks the start of a VXID
The first record of a VXID transaction.
.sp
The format is:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
%s %d %s [%u]
|  |  |   |
|  |  |   +\- Task sub\-level
|  |  +\-\-\-\-\- Reason
|  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Parent vxid
+\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Type (\(dqsess\(dq, \(dqreq\(dq or \(dqbereq\(dq)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.TP
