|  |  |  |  |  |
|  |  |  |  |  +\- Total bytes received
|  |  |  |  +\-\-\-\- Body bytes received
|  |  |  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Header bytes received
|  |  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Total bytes transmitted
|  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Body bytes transmitted
+\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Header bytes transmitted
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.TP
.B BereqHeader \- Backend request header
HTTP header contents.
.sp
The format is:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
