|   |
|   +\- Header value
+\-\-\-\-\- Header name
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
NOTE: HTTP header fields are free form records and not strictly
made of 2 fields. Accessing a specific header with the prefix
notation helps treating the header value as a single string.
