|  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Remaining TTL
+\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- VXID of the object
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
