%u %f
|  |
|  +\- Remaining TTL
+\-\-\-\- VXID of the object
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.TP
.B HttpGarbage \- Unparseable HTTP request
Logs the content of unparseable HTTP requests.
.TP
.B Length \- Size of object body
Logs the size of a fetch object body.
.TP
.B Link \- Links to a child VXID
