|  +\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Child vxid
+\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- Child type (\(dqsess\(dq, \(dqreq\(dq or \(dqbereq\(dq)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.TP
.B LostHeader \- Failed attempt to set HTTP header
