.UNINDENT
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B Explanation of reasons (first column):
.INDENT 7.0
.IP \(bu 2
\fBREM_CLOSE\fP: Client Closed
.IP \(bu 2
\fBREQ_CLOSE\fP: Client requested close
.IP \(bu 2
\fBREQ_HTTP10\fP: Proto < HTTP/1.1
.IP \(bu 2
\fBRX_BAD\fP: Received bad req/resp
.IP \(bu 2
\fBRX_BODY\fP: Failure receiving body
.IP \(bu 2
\fBRX_JUNK\fP: Received junk data
.IP \(bu 2
\fBRX_OVERFLOW\fP: Received buffer overflow
.IP \(bu 2
\fBRX_TIMEOUT\fP: Receive timeout
.IP \(bu 2
\fBRX_CLOSE_IDLE\fP: timeout_idle reached
.IP \(bu 2
\fBTX_PIPE\fP: Piped transaction
.IP \(bu 2
\fBTX_ERROR\fP: Error transaction
.IP \(bu 2
\fBTX_EOF\fP: EOF transmission
.IP \(bu 2
\fBRESP_CLOSE\fP: Backend/VCL requested close
.IP \(bu 2
\fBOVERLOAD\fP: Out of some resource
.IP \(bu 2
\fBPIPE_OVERFLOW\fP: Session pipe overflow
.IP \(bu 2
\fBRANGE_SHORT\fP: Insufficient data for range
.IP \(bu 2
\fBREQ_HTTP20\fP: HTTP2 not accepted
.IP \(bu 2
\fBVCL_FAILURE\fP: VCL failure
.IP \(bu 2
\fBRAPID_RESET\fP: HTTP2 rapid reset
